                "description": "Victorian Violet Knob With Floral Rose Fusion 18-D8 - The ornate Victorian Violet Knob with the Floral Rose is a sparkling reminder of the old world. Available in 5 finishes, all of which enhance the elegant allure of this knob set. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
